{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade! Inc.</strong> \u2013 the satisfying text-based idle game where your goal is simple: make the numbers go up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your company from a single operation into a profitable enterprise. Invest in production lines, upgrade your facilities, and hire employees for powerful bonuses. Dive deeper by unlocking powerful research projects of varying rarities to gain significant advantages and accelerate your growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076340/extras/c820667e4a08ab6262ffb30a09271796.avif?t=1764696043\" width=1223 height=318 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Progression:</strong> Unlock and upgrade a series of production lines in an intuitive gameplay loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Research:</strong> Discover research with different rarity levels to give your company unique and game-changing boosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire a Team:</strong> Recruit employees who provide strategic bonuses to optimize your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Idle Experience:</strong> A clean, minimalist interface makes this the perfect chill game to have running in the background.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Processing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4076340/4f2f98a7ebd6ecac8303cc0fe491ab5f3ac9552f.jpg"},{"name":"Water is gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4076340/04c758201f58c0ebca99e982d2f642ef546d2273.jpg"},{"name":"All good things..","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat